  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Bangladesh Safe Migration for Bangladeshi Workers</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the project is to reduce vulnerability of migrant workers and their families in 80 upazilas through a demonstration pilot that (i) provides better access to accurate and timely information and services for safe migration; and (ii) establishes andstrengthens community-based organizations (CBOs) in order to reduce dependency of migrants on middlemen.</narrative>
  </description>
